Note 1 : In Type 1 Construction, All Structural Components Shall Be 4 Hour Fire Resistance;
Note 2 : In Type 2 Construction, All Structural Components Shall Be 3 Hour Fire Resistance;
Note 3 : In Type 3 Construction, All Structural Components Shall Be 2 Hour Fire Resistance;
Note 4 : In Type 4 Construction, All Structural Components Shall Be 1 Hour Fire Resistance;
1.1
The fire resistance of various materials and construction schemes shall conform to accepted standards of the National
Building Code, 1970.
